window main "Claude Code 供应商切换器" scheme=light
focused: button "Got it"
tree:
  region "Notifications alt+T"
  dialog "Welcome to CC Switch"
    heading "Welcome to CC Switch"
    text "CC Switch lets you switch between multiple Claude Code / Codex / Gemini CLI providers with a single click. If you already had these tools configured, CC Switch has saved your existing setup as a provider named “default” so none of your previous configuration is lost."
    text "An “Official” preset is also included in the list — click it any time you want to switch back to the official default. CC Switch automatically backs up your current config to “default” before switching, so you can move back and forth freely. That's how CC Switch works 😊"
    button "Got it" [focused]
announcements since the previous checkpoint:
